store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896760/extras/e7dd92c478a2f9a230e392c739d8587c.poster.avif?t=1771401556\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896760/extras/e7dd92c478a2f9a230e392c739d8587c.webm?t=1771401556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>On your quest for vengeance, you'll have to <strong>overcome Bosses and Mini-Bosses</strong> that will challenge your skills in different ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4-Player </strong>Local Co-Op and Versus Modes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>7 lengthy stages</strong> spanning the world (and even further)! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>multiple difficulties</strong> for those seeking more challenge! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your high score in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up <strong> temporary weapons </strong>to spice up combat! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to remember control scheme</strong>! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All characters can run</strong>, so you never feel slow! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896760/extras/c6f003f284502d46810faa9d5e49627d.poster.avif?t=1771401556\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896760/extras/c6f003f284502d46810faa9d5e49627d.webm?t=1771401556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Dummy Dojo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://sh